{
    "_id": "bourbon-lift",
    "name": "Bourbon Lift",
    "instructions": "1. Add the bourbon, coffee liqueur, heavy cream and orgeat into a shaker and vigorously dry-shake (without ice) for 10 seconds. Add ice and shake again until well-chilled.\n2. Strain into a Collins glass.\n3. Fill with the club soda, pouring from about 6 inches above the glass.\n4. Wait a few seconds and then add another splash of soda. This will lift the foam above the top of the glass.\n5. Serve with a straw.",
